👥 **HR Analytics Dashboard | Power BI**

Excited to share my HR Analytics Dashboard project built using Microsoft Power BI! 📊

Through this project, I analyzed employee data to identify workforce trends and understand the factors influencing employee attrition.

**Key Highlights:**

📌 Total Employee Count Analysis  
📌 Employee Attrition Count & Attrition Rate  
📌 Average Age, Salary & Years at Company  
📌 Department-wise Attrition Analysis  
📌 Gender-wise Employee Attrition  
📌 Education Field-wise Attrition Analysis  
📌 Job Role-wise Attrition  
📌 Age Group-wise Attrition Analysis  
📌 Salary Slab-wise Attrition Analysis  

**Tools & Skills Used:**

🔹 Power BI  
🔹 Data Cleaning & Data Transformation  
🔹 Data Analysis & Visualization  
🔹 Interactive Charts  
🔹 KPI Cards

This project helped me understand employee attrition patterns and explore how HR analytics can support better workforce planning and data-driven decision-making.
